  "rules": [
   "at each completed daily close (18:00 NY day, stubs < 600 M1 dropped)",
   "daily order flow = latest one-sided daily-close reaction to a live daily FVG (<= 60 days memory); must be non-neutral",
   "expansion anticipated in the order-flow direction when none of the consolidation triggers fire (first weekly H/L take this week; 3 same-direction closes or two ranges >= 1.5x ADR20; close within 0.40-0.60 of the daily dealing range)",
